<title>USA: Wells Fargo Q1 net up, per share falls.</title>
<headline>Wells Fargo Q1 net up, per share falls.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.62		    $5.39</p>
<p> Net			329,000		  254,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  90,800		   47,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Wells Fargo and Co.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 results reflect merger with First Interstate, so not comparable with Q1 1996.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 1997 estimate was $3.77.</p>
</text>
